# Prefix persona-neutral components with `User`

When a component or screen is applicable to **all** personas (client, agent, and
business) rather than one specific persona, name it with a `User` prefix and put
shared screens in `src/screens/shared/`. Do not name a cross-persona component
after a single persona (e.g. `Client...`, `Agent...`, `Business...`), since that
is misleading when every persona reuses it.

## Examples

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — persona-specific name, but reused by client, agent, and business
// src/screens/client/ClientAccountsScreen.tsx
export default observer(ClientAccountsScreenBase);

// ✅ GOOD — persona-neutral name, lives in screens/shared
// src/screens/shared/UserAccountsScreen.tsx
export default observer(UserAccountsScreenBase);
```

## Guidance

- Persona-specific component → keep the persona prefix (`AgentStatusBar`, `ClientTopUpDialog`).
- Used by every persona → `User` prefix (`UserAccountsScreen`, `UserProfileCard`).
- Place `User`-prefixed screens in `src/screens/shared/`, not under a persona folder.
